title: "forecast-value-added: forecast value added analysis and demand classification for demand planners"
abstract: "A Python library and CLI that measures whether each step of a demand forecasting process (statistical model, planner override, consensus) improves on a naive benchmark, with Syntetos-Boylan demand classification, ABC-XYZ segmentation, override analysis and tracking signals."
